cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Raw calibration data of single-point-type tactile pressure sensors (TPS)
message: If you use this data, please cite both the dataset and the article below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Chang
    family-names: Guo
    affiliation: The Hong Kong Polytechnic University
  - given-names: Chao
    family-names: Zhou
    affiliation: The Hong Kong Polytechnic University
repository-code: https://github.com/PolyU-GUO/tpssensor
url: https://github.com/PolyU-GUO/tpssensor
abstract: >-
  Raw post-installation calibration records of 18 single-point-type tactile pressure sensors
  (15 TPS-ICPT and 3 TPS-EPC, labelled 101-118). Calibration was performed in a sealed pressure
  tank with pressures raised stepwise to 60, 100 or 200 kPa and released back to 0 kPa at 4 kPa/min.
  Each record gives the applied pressure (kPa) and the electrical resistance (Ohm) of every sensor,
  together with the non-linearity error of each sensor for the loading, unloading and loop paths.
keywords:
  - tactile pressure sensor
  - earth pressure cell
  - soil-structure interface
  - contact pressure
  - sensor calibration
  - piezoresistive sensor
